    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20051111.0065\n\nBEIJING, Nov. 11 , 2005 (Xinhua)\n\nShanghai stock index closed up -- Nov. 11\n\n\n\n\nThe Composite Stock Index on the Shanghai Stock Exchange closed at 1,089.42 points on Friday, up 1.12 points from the previous close.\n\nA Share Index: 1,145.05 points, up 1.13 points;\n\nB Share Index: 60.86 points, up 0.30 points;\n\nTotal Turnover: 8,182,930,000 yuan.",
